{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51505","headline":"题惠山泉（二首） 二 · 皮日休","name":"题惠山泉（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马卿消瘦年才有，陆羽茶门近始闲。\n时借僧炉拾寒叶，自来林下煮潺湲。\n（元《无锡县志》卷四上辞章咏歌。\n又明《弘治无锡县志》二八《词章》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}